WEBVTT

09:02.735 --> 09:05.029
This is your home. I'm your guest.

09:08.366 --> 09:10.409
Handsome one, isn't he?

09:11.119 --> 09:15.665
I lost my first boy,
a little black-haired beauty.

09:15.790 --> 09:17.667
He was a fighter too -

09:17.792 --> 09:19.877
tried to beat the fever that took him.

09:21.963 --> 09:23.965
Forgive me.

09:24.090 --> 09:25.967
It's the last thing you
need to hear right now.

09:26.092 --> 09:28.094
I never knew.

09:28.219 --> 09:30.096
It was years ago.
